{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13499","headline":"南溪别业 · 蒋冽","name":"南溪别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结宇依青嶂，开轩对绿畴。\n树交花两色，溪合水同流。\n竹径春来扫，兰尊夜不收。\n逍遥自得意，鼓腹醉中游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}